<section class="document-page">
<h1>Account balance certificate</h1><p class="sandbox-label"><strong>Sandbox specimen</strong> · Fictional institution and customer data.</p><p class="document-reference">${facts.documentReference} · ${facts.issuedOn}</p>
<dl class="key-details"><div><dt>Named customer</dt><dd>${facts.partyName}</dd></div><div><dt>Account</dt><dd>${facts.accountNumber}</dd></div><div><dt>Account reference</dt><dd>${facts.accountReference}</dd></div><div><dt>Currency</dt><dd>${facts.currency}</dd></div><div><dt>Historical cutoff</dt><dd>${facts.asOf}</dd></div><div><dt>Value date</dt><dd>${facts.valueDate}</dd></div><div><dt>Reporting time zone</dt><dd>${facts.reportingTimeZone}</dd></div><div><dt>Ledger sequence</dt><dd>${facts.ledgerSequence}</dd></div></dl><h2>Balances at the retained cutoff</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Balance role</th><th scope="col">${facts.currency}</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Booked balance</td><td class="amount">${facts.bookedBalance?number?string["#,##0.00"]}</td></tr><tr><td>Active held amount</td><td class="amount">${facts.heldAmount?number?string["#,##0.00"]}</td></tr><tr><td>Cash available, excluding credit facilities</td><td class="amount">${facts.cashAvailable?number?string["#,##0.00"]}</td></tr></tbody></table>
<div class="document-legal-note"><strong>Demonstration document.</strong> Firefly Sandbox Financial Services is a fictional demonstration entity. This is an unsigned sandbox specimen with fictional data, not an approved customer form, legal certification, audited report, signature or payment evidence. Approved institution details, source facts, product terms and jurisdiction wording require their own governed revision and authorization.</div>
</section>
<section class="document-page">
<h2>Historical balance basis and source notes</h2><p class="sandbox-label"><strong>Sandbox specimen</strong> · Fictional institution and customer data.</p><p class="document-reference">${facts.documentReference} · ${facts.issuedOn}</p>
<h2>Basis and meaning</h2><p>Cash available equals booked balance less the active holds in this supplied snapshot. No credit-facility capacity is included. This is not a promise that a new payment will be authorized: current controls, limits and concurrent activity still apply.</p><p>Cutoff policy: Booked entries effective on or before the cutoff. The owning ledger must supply a genuine historical extraction, including the correct effective/booking cutoff and source sequence. Relabeling today’s balance with an earlier date is invalid. This specimen’s booked amount reconciles to the separate September statement; the hold snapshot has its own ledger reference.</p><p>Later corrections require a new certificate with explicit predecessor lineage. They do not rewrite this retained document. A balance certificate is separate from an account ownership certificate, a financial balance sheet or proof of settlement. Verification reference: ${facts.verificationReference}.</p><h2>Referenced records</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Snapshot</th><th scope="col">Version</th></tr></thead><tbody><#list facts.sources as row><tr><td>${row.resourceReference}</td><td>${row.version}</td></tr></#list></tbody></table>

<div class="document-legal-note"><strong>Demonstration document.</strong> Firefly Sandbox Financial Services is a fictional demonstration entity. This is an unsigned sandbox specimen with fictional data, not an approved customer form, legal certification, audited report, signature or payment evidence. Approved institution details, source facts, product terms and jurisdiction wording require their own governed revision and authorization.</div>
</section>
